# OS / editor cruft — never publish
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/

# p/, b/ and view/ ARE committed here — but ONLY by THIS repo's own permalinks
# workflow (.github/workflows/permalinks.yml + tools/bt-site.cjs), which renders
# them from the REAL published feed on its built-in GITHUB_TOKEN, with no
# credentials. It is not the app repo's workflow: the app repo BUILDS bt-site.cjs
# and it is copied here as an artefact, and nothing in the app repo can write to
# this tree. (The Python generate.py it replaced was retired 2026-08-19.)
# Never hand-edit them, never commit a locally generated copy (a local run may be
# built from the sample fixtures — fabricated bill pages would be the single
# most damaging thing this repo could publish; it is why --out is required).
